      "sender": "Yara Mallow (Tenant, Flat 3)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "- **From:** Yara Mallow (Tenant, Flat 3)",
      "start": 22,
      "end": 62
    },
    {
      "id": "001:L3",
      "event_id": "001",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:12:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Yara Mallow (Tenant, Flat 3)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "- **To:** Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 63,
      "end": 125
    },
    {
      "id": "001:L5",
      "event_id": "001",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:12:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Yara Mallow (Tenant, Flat 3)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "I have been told there is water coming through the ceiling of Flat 2, below my bathroom. I cannot see a leak in my flat. Please contact me before anyone comes to Flat 3.",
      "start": 127,
      "end": 296
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L1",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:19:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L2",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:19:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L3",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:19:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Bevin Orlo (Tenant, Flat 2)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 122
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L5",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:19:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Bevin reported water dripping from a bedroom ceiling light fitting and spreading across the ceiling. A bowl is underneath; the bed has been moved. Bevin said the wall switch is off but does not know whether the circuit is isolated.",
      "start": 124,
      "end": 355
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L1",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:27:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L2",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:27:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L3",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:27:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Bevin Orlo (Tenant, Flat 2)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 122
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L5",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:27:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Arlen told Bevin not to touch the wet fitting, nearby switches, or the ceiling, and to keep people out of the affected bedroom. Arlen clarified that a wall switch being off does not establish that the fitting is electrically safe. Bevin was asked not to try an unfamiliar consumer-unit breaker and to call emergency services if there were sparks, smoke, falling material, or an immediate danger.",
      "start": 124,
      "end": 519
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L1",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:34:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Bevin Orlo (Tenant, Flat 2)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "- **Channel:** SMS",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L2",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:34:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Bevin Orlo (Tenant, Flat 2)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "- **From:** Bevin Orlo (Tenant, Flat 2)",
      "start": 19,
      "end": 58
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L3",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:34:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Bevin Orlo (Tenant, Flat 2)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "- **To:** Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 59,
      "end": 121
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L5",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:34:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Bevin Orlo (Tenant, Flat 2)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "I have left the bedroom and am keeping the door closed. The dripping continues. No sparks or smoke that I can see.",
      "start": 123,
      "end": 237
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L1",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:43:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L2",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:43:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L3",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:43:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Selka Venn (Building Manager, Tallowmere Row)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 140
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L5",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:43:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Arlen asked whether Selka could identify a water isolation point or a building emergency-access procedure. Selka said she was checking the riser labels and building file; neither was confirmed at that time.",
      "start": 142,
      "end": 348
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L1",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:51:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L2",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:51:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L3",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:51:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Niko Pell (Landlord, Flat 3)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 123
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L5",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 08:51:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Arlen reported active ingress, the wet light fitting below, and Yara's request to be contacted before entry. Niko said he was away, had no key, and had not given standing permission for entry in his absence. He asked to be updated before any non-routine access.",
      "start": 125,
      "end": 386
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L1",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Bevin Orlo (Tenant, Flat 2)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Portal",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L2",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Bevin Orlo (Tenant, Flat 2)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "- **From:** Bevin Orlo (Tenant, Flat 2)",
      "start": 22,
      "end": 61
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L3",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Bevin Orlo (Tenant, Flat 2)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "- **To:** Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 62,
      "end": 124
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L5",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Bevin Orlo (Tenant, Flat 2)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "Bevin reported water at the ceiling light and a damp patch extending toward the bedroom wall. Bevin could not identify the source or confirm conditions in the space above the ceiling and asked that the details be kept within the maintenance team.",
      "start": 126,
      "end": 372
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L1",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:15:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L2",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:15:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L3",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:15:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Daro Fen (Contractor, Brindle Flow Plumbing)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 139
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L5",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:15:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Arlen described the active leak and suspected Flat 3 as a possible source, not a confirmed one. Daro could attend from 10:30 but said source tracing would require access to the source flat. He could not identify or isolate an unknown supply from Flat 2.",
      "start": 141,
      "end": 394
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L1",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L2",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L3",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Yara Mallow (Tenant, Flat 3)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 123
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L5",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Yara said she would not agree to entry while away and could not return before 17:30. She asked that no key be used. She could answer calls during a break around noon.",
      "start": 125,
      "end": 291
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L1",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:37:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Selka Venn (Building Manager, Tallowmere Row)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L2",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:37:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Selka Venn (Building Manager, Tallowmere Row)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Selka Venn (Building Manager, Tallowmere Row)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 77
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L3",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:37:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Selka Venn (Building Manager, Tallowmere Row)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 78,
      "end": 140
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L5",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:37:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Selka Venn (Building Manager, Tallowmere Row)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Selka offered to meet Daro at 10:30 and provide access to the common riser. The labels are incomplete, and Selka cannot confirm that any valve serves only Flat 3. Selka has no key to either flat.",
      "start": 142,
      "end": 337
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L1",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:49:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Niko Pell (Landlord, Flat 3)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L2",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:49:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Niko Pell (Landlord, Flat 3)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Niko Pell (Landlord, Flat 3)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 61
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L3",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:49:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Niko Pell (Landlord, Flat 3)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 62,
      "end": 124
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L5",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 09:49:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Niko Pell (Landlord, Flat 3)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Niko said the tenancy paperwork refers to repairs on notice and separately mentions urgent repairs, but he did not have the full wording available. He was not expressly authorizing entry where Yara had refused consent.",
      "start": 126,
      "end": 344
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L1",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L2",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L3",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Bevin Orlo (Tenant, Flat 2)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 122
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L5",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Bevin reported faster dripping and a new brown patch beside the fitting. No section had fallen. Bevin had not touched the consumer unit and remained outside the bedroom.",
      "start": 124,
      "end": 293
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L1",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:14:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L2",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:14:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L3",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:14:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Daro Fen (Contractor, Brindle Flow Plumbing)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 139
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L5",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:14:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Arlen confirmed Daro's 10:30 attendance for Flat 2 and the common riser, with Selka meeting him. Bevin agreed to provide access to Flat 2. Daro confirmed this would not provide access to Flat 3 or establish which supply, if any, could be isolated.",
      "start": 141,
      "end": 388
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L1",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:22:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L2",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:22:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L3",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:22:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Runa Elt (Contractor, Vellum Electrical)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 135
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L5",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:22:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Arlen requested an urgent qualified electrical attendance for the wet ceiling fitting in Flat 2. Runa confirmed electrical qualifications and offered an attendance window of 12:30–13:15, subject to the tenant providing access. Runa would assess the fitting and circuit; no assessment had yet occurred.",
      "start": 137,
      "end": 438
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L1",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:31:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "- **Channel:** SMS",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L2",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:31:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "- **From:** Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 19,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L3",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:31:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "- **To:** Bevin Orlo (Tenant, Flat 2)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 121
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L5",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:31:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "Arlen confirmed the electrician request and asked Bevin to keep the bedroom clear and avoid the fitting and wet ceiling. Bevin replied that they would meet the electrician and continue using the other rooms.",
      "start": 123,
      "end": 330
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L1",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:48:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Daro Fen (Contractor, Brindle Flow Plumbing)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L2",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:48:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Daro Fen (Contractor, Brindle Flow Plumbing)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Daro Fen (Contractor, Brindle Flow Plumbing)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 76
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L3",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:48:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Daro Fen (Contractor, Brindle Flow Plumbing)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 77,
      "end": 139
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L5",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 10:48:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Daro Fen (Contractor, Brindle Flow Plumbing)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Daro and Selka had met as arranged. Daro had access to Flat 2 and the common riser. He saw water at the bedroom ceiling but could not locate the source. The riser labels did not identify a confirmed Flat 3 branch; no valve had been operated. Flat 3 remained inaccessible.",
      "start": 141,
      "end": 412
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L1",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 11:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L2",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 11:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L3",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-06-18 11:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Arlen Quist (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
